# Immutable image references rendered into k8s/*.yaml by scripts/render_k8s.py.
# The bootstrap digests below are updated automatically by
# .github/workflows/images.yml after the first successful image build. Do not
# deploy them as-is; run `make k8s-render` and check the rendered output.
